WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.505
Your coding agent

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:02.189
can now draft

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:02.814
your Apple Mail

00:00:02.626 --> 00:00:03.439
replies

00:00:03.966 --> 00:00:04.862
Mailpipe is a

00:00:04.674 --> 00:00:05.899
now open-source Mac

00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:06.513
app that lets

00:00:06.324 --> 00:00:07.114
an agent you

00:00:06.938 --> 00:00:08.022
already use draft

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:08.777
replies in Apple

00:00:08.589 --> 00:00:09.190
Mail

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:11.133
Pick Codex CLI

00:00:11.015 --> 00:00:11.840
Claude Code

00:00:11.876 --> 00:00:13.338
OpenCode and others

00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:14.267
You review

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:15.410
